        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "In the days when Maelore was causing his mischief around Hightop City it was found that the dread lich used Orbs of Attraction to draw evil to the lands around the city.\n\nMaelore may have been defeated, but it seems that one of his orbs survived and was being used to cause unrest in the land."
          }
        }
      },
      {
