        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "This is a great day indeed, for now we can send this orb to its destruction, and lessen the stranglehold evil has on these lands.\n\nYet, I fear even that will not put an end to it all.  There is some force that is guiding these events, some unknown enemy that lives still.\n\nBut, that is a discussion for another time.  I thank you for your good work here today."
          }
        }
