            "0": "I apologize, but I am too busy to stand around in idle chatter.  I recently recieved an interesting letter discovered by a collegue which the source of many of our problems might be in the area.\n\nSay, come to think of it, maybe I am interested in a little chatter, if you are up for a little exploration?"
          }
